	<!-- EN: The military level directly affects the settlement's ability to defend itself and attack external threats. -->
  <FCSettlementMilitaryLevelDesc>軍事レベルは入植地の自衛能力および外部の脅威への攻撃能力に直接影響します。</FCSettlementMilitaryLevelDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall happiness.

A high happiness means that any internal conflict within the settlement will lean heavily to your favor.
	 -->
  <FCSettlementHappinessDesc>入植地全体の幸福度を示します。

幸福度が高いと、入植地内部の紛争があなたに有利に傾きやすくなります。
	 </FCSettlementHappinessDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall loyalty.

The loyalty of a settlement determines how willing the settlement is to listen to you. A high loyalty will reduce the chance of defection.
	 -->
  <FCSettlementLoyaltyDesc>入植地全体の忠誠心を示します。

入植地の忠誠心は、入植地があなたの指示に従う意志を決定します。忠誠心が高いと離反の可能性が減少します。
	 </FCSettlementLoyaltyDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall unrest.

The higher unrest grows, the more likely dangerous events internal in your Settlement will spark. Let it grow too high, and a Settlement-wide revolt may grow.
	 -->
  <FCSettlementUnrestDesc>入植地全体の不満度を示します。

不満が高まるほど、入植地内部で危険なイベントが発生しやすくなります。放置すると入植地全体での反乱が起きる可能性があります。
	 </FCSettlementUnrestDesc>
	<!-- EN: The measure of the Settlement's overall prosperity.

The prosperity of a settlement directly correlates with the production of resources (e.g. 50% prosperity = 50% production). Prosperity drifts toward a target determined by the settlement's happiness, loyalty, and unrest.
	 -->
  <FCSettlementProsperityDesc>入植地全体の繁栄度を示します。

繁栄度は資源の生産量に直接相関します（例：繁栄度50%＝生産量50%）。繁栄度は入植地の幸福度・忠誠心・不満度によって決まる目標値に向かって推移します。
	 </FCSettlementProsperityDesc>

